-- **Time Complexity**: $O(1)$ per face check [S1, S2, unofficial].
-- **Memory Complexity**: $O(N)$ for the `visited` array, where $N$ is the number of voxels or faces [S1, unofficial].
-- **Strengths**: Simple to implement; effectively removes redundant vertices and indices for opaque blocks [S2, unofficial].
