 ## Background
-The method originates from voxel meshing libraries like `block-mesh-rs` [S1, unofficial] and discussions on face culling for voxel cubes [S2, unofficial]. It is a foundational step in generating efficient meshes from voxel data by eliminating internal faces between opaque blocks.
